Comment: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:07.24,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,随着8月接近尾声
Comment: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:09.11,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,是不是有种「夏天要结束了」
Comment: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:10.28,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,的感觉呢？
Comment: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.91,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,确实
Comment: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:14.87,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,虽然有时候9月也几乎像夏天一样
Comment: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:16.95,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,可能小学生暑假的感觉
Comment: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:18.50,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,比较强烈吧
Comment: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:20.79,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,小时候的篠崎先生…
Comment: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:22.29,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,想看！
Comment: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:23.92,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,下次 把毕业纪念册
Comment: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:25.63,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,带来看看 行不行呢？
Comment: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:27.63,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,诶 我的吗？
Comment: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:29.34,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以是可以
Comment: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:32.05,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,要是前辈也给我看你的话
Comment: 0,0:00:32.05,0:00:34.43,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,我 我也会带的…
Comment: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:36.76,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,那 那样的话…我铁定带来！
Comment: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:43.19,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,面包店啦 蛋糕店啦…
Comment: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:44.36,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,从以前就对吃
